Read a CIF as a traceable model and compare it with its original evidence (@mp-cif: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mineralogy-and-petrology, #source "../sources/Crystallography-Open-Database.lingua#r_0GWYXPDY9KYA4V4AXPCEFJG9RG", #source "../sources/Mineralogy-Perkins.lingua#r_3Y3EJ93EG4V7Q0TZBCRRXVNVKP", #source "../sources/IUCr-Crystallographic-Teaching.lingua#r_334MQS5KEVRJ17XKK0WKCP6KWX", #source "../sources/GSAS-II-Refinement-Tutorials.lingua#r_14B5VSDN6YR5MQJVNTKYJXF3XB", #mineralogy-and-petrology "Raman-spectra-processing-and-mineral-identification.lingua#r_74ZXVR1CEKVKVG97CK96KZ2SKT") { r_1SVFJVQWKZM86VHF3Z5Y2XWVX1
**Read:** [Crystallography Open Database — structures, citations, and CIF records](../sources/Crystallography-Open-Database.lingua#r_0GWYXPDY9KYA4V4AXPCEFJG9RG), one complete selected record with its original publication; [Mineralogy — Dexter Perkins, open editions](../sources/Mineralogy-Perkins.lingua#r_3Y3EJ93EG4V7Q0TZBCRRXVNVKP), the complete structure/analysis explanation; [Crystallographic teaching pamphlets — IUCr](../sources/IUCr-Crystallographic-Teaching.lingua#r_334MQS5KEVRJ17XKK0WKCP6KWX), the relevant complete structure/symmetry method; [GSAS-II — diffraction analysis and refinement tutorials](../sources/GSAS-II-Refinement-Tutorials.lingua#r_14B5VSDN6YR5MQJVNTKYJXF3XB), the full CIF/publication exercise where applicable.

A crystallographic information file carries a representation of composition, cell, symmetry, atomic sites, occupancies, displacement information, refinement, and provenance where supplied. Missing, uncertain, constrained, and measured fields have different meanings. A syntactically readable file is not proof that every model parameter is physically established.

Check units, setting/origin, multiplicities, occupancy conventions, constraints, formula content, and measurement conditions. Fractional occupancy and displacement can be correlated with other parameters or reflect averaged disorder. A structure drawing can conceal these qualifications.

Use an identified COD record and original paper, preserving revision and original authors. Calculate cell contents and an independent density/distance/spacing check. Compare reported uncertainty and residual/validation information with what the model claims. Several deposited structures for one species can reflect different composition, conditions, data quality, or revision.

**Work:** reconstruct one structural claim from its complete paper and CIF. Check chemical/site/charge consistency and a geometric prediction independently. Compare an alternative setting or plausible model and identify an observable distinction rather than choosing the prettier visualization. Document what the available data cannot resolve.

Read the full relevant crystallographic and refinement treatment. No bulk database ingestion or custom parser is required to study a chosen record; ordinary source links preserve access to the evidence and the original attribution.

